4874 0 obj<</Title(A. Operation and Maintenance Manuals \(O&M Manuals\) shall contain:)/Parent 4873 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[3343 0 R/XYZ 86 600 0]>>/Next 4875 0 R>>
endobj
4875 0 obj<</Title(B. Prior to substantial completion, submit an electronic copy of the O&M manual in PDF format to the Architect, Engineer and C.O. for Review and approval. The PDF shall be one file with an index and hyperlinks to each section. Individual bound PDFs without automated navigation will be rejected. All O&M data shall be grouped by the equipment type and ordered by the specification numbering.)/Parent 4873 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[3343 0 R/XYZ 86 434 0]>>/Prev 4874 0 R/Next 4876 0 R>>
endobj
4876 0 obj<</Title(C. Prior to final payment a final electronic copy of the O&M manual on an archival quality DVD as well as two printed copies, shall be furnished to the C.O.. Printed copies shall have commercial quality 8-1/2\216 x 11\216 3-ring binders with tabbed dividers for each section.)/Parent 4873 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[3343 0 R/XYZ 86 373 0]>>/Prev 4875 0 R>>
endobj
4877 0 obj<</Title(1.15 AS-BUILT RECORD DRAWINGS)/Parent 4799 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[3343 0 R/XYZ 72 334 0]>>/Prev 4873 0 R/First 4878 0 R/Last 4880 0 R/Count 3/Next 4881 0 R>>
endobj
4878 0 obj<</Title(A. The Contractor shall furnish to the C.O. and Architect/Engineer a marked print showing the location of all concealed or underground pipe or conduit runs and other equipment installed other than as shown on the drawings. Dimension underground lines from established building lines. Indicate all installed pull boxes in conduit runs.)/Parent 4877 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[3343 0 R/XYZ 86 319 0]>>/Next 4879 0 R>>
endobj
4879 0 obj<</Title(B. The Contractor shall furnish to the C.O. a marked print showing the location of all mechanical equipment, plumbing fixtures, piping, ductwork, diffusers, grilles, etc.  The location of any item which deviates from the bid documents shall be accurately drawn and dimensioned.)/Parent 4877 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[3343 0 R/XYZ 86 269 0]>>/Prev 4878 0 R/Next 4880 0 R>>
endobj
4880 0 obj<</Title(C. All underground piping and ductwork shall be dimensioned from nearest column and/or exterior walls.  The location of all maintenance related items, such as duct access doors, fire dampers, isolation valves, filters, etc., shall be highlighted on the as built drawing.)/Parent 4877 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[3343 0 R/XYZ 86 230 0]>>/Prev 4879 0 R>>
endobj
