10295 0 obj<</Title(1.01 SUMMARY)/Parent 10294 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 72 672 0]>>/First 10296 0 R/Last 10300 0 R/Count 5/Next 10301 0 R>>
endobj
10296 0 obj<</Title(A. The requirements listed in this section are supplemental to the Division 01 General Requirements.)/Parent 10295 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 656 0]>>/Next 10297 0 R>>
endobj
10297 0 obj<</Title(B. It shall be the responsibility of the Electrical and Low-voltage Contractors to examine and refer to all Architectural, Civil, Structural, Mechanical, Plumbing and Landscape drawings and specifications for construction conditions which may affect the scope of Electrical, Communications, Electronic Safety and Security work. Inspect the building site and existing facilities for verification of present conditions. Make proper provisions for these conditions in performance of the work and cost thereof.)/Parent 10295 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 641 0]>>/Prev 10296 0 R/Next 10298 0 R>>
endobj
10298 0 obj<</Title(C. Electrical, Communications, Electronic Safety and Security work for this project shall include all items, articles, materials and the associated labor mentioned, schedules or shown in these specifications and in the accompanying drawings.)/Parent 10295 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 567 0]>>/Prev 10297 0 R/Next 10299 0 R>>
endobj
10299 0 obj<</Title(D. Furnish and install all equipment, materials and any required incidental items required by good practice to complete the systems described herein.)/Parent 10295 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 528 0]>>/Prev 10298 0 R/Next 10300 0 R>>
endobj
10300 0 obj<</Title(E. Refer to Division 01 for all listed Alternates and provide separate pricing and work as indicated in Division 01 and Contract Documents.)/Parent 10295 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 501 0]>>/Prev 10299 0 R>>
endobj
10301 0 obj<</Title(1.02 DEFINITIONS - Throughout contract documents these words and phrases are used:)/Parent 10294 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 72 474 0]>>/Prev 10295 0 R/First 10302 0 R/Last 10310 0 R/Count 9/Next 10311 0 R>>
endobj
10302 0 obj<</Title(A. Contract documents - All drawings, specifications, addenda and change orders that document work to be done.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 458 0]>>/Next 10303 0 R>>
endobj
10303 0 obj<</Title(B. Demolition \205 Carefully disconnect and remove items. All reasonable caution shall be taken to avoid damaging removed equipment and to retain its operability.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 431 0]>>/Prev 10302 0 R/Next 10304 0 R>>
endobj
10304 0 obj<</Title(C. Remove back to source - Remove all conduit and wire back to panelboard or last live device.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 403 0]>>/Prev 10303 0 R/Next 10305 0 R>>
endobj
10305 0 obj<</Title(D. Equivalent or equal - Product of like type and function that complies with all applicable provisions of drawings and specifications and which has been approved as substitute for specified item.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 388 0]>>/Prev 10304 0 R/Next 10306 0 R>>
endobj
10306 0 obj<</Title(E. Furnish - Purchase material as shown and specified, and place material to approved location on site or elsewhere as noted or agreed upon.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 360 0]>>/Prev 10305 0 R/Next 10307 0 R>>
endobj
10307 0 obj<</Title(F. Install - Set in place and connect, ready for use and in complete and properly operating finished condition.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 333 0]>>/Prev 10306 0 R/Next 10308 0 R>>
endobj
10308 0 obj<</Title(G. Provide - Furnish and install with all products, labor, sub-contracts, and appurtenances required for a complete and properly operating, finished condition.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 306 0]>>/Prev 10307 0 R/Next 10309 0 R>>
endobj
10309 0 obj<</Title(H. Rough-in - Provide conduit raceway system with junction boxes, fittings, straps, BUSHINGS, etc., for future installation of wiring, devices, disconnects and breakers. Provision shall be made in panelboard \(hardware, etc.\) for future installation of breakers.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 278 0]>>/Prev 10308 0 R/Next 10310 0 R>>
endobj
10310 0 obj<</Title(I. Serviceable - Arranged so that component or product in question may be properly removed and replaced without disassembly, destruction or damage to surrounding installation.)/Parent 10301 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 240 0]>>/Prev 10309 0 R>>
endobj
10311 0 obj<</Title(1.03 CODES, STANDARDS AND REGULATIONS)/Parent 10294 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 72 212 0]>>/Prev 10301 0 R/First 10312 0 R/Last 10315 0 R/Count 3/Next 10316 0 R>>
endobj
10312 0 obj<</Title(A. Codes - Perform all work in strict accordance with all applicable national, state and local codes; including, but not limited to latest legally enacted editions of following codes:)/Parent 10311 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8181 0 R/XYZ 86 197 0]>>/Next 10314 0 R>>
endobj
10314 0 obj<</Title(B. Standards - Reference to standards infers that installation, equipment and material shall be within limits for which it was designed, tested and approved, in conformance with current publications and standards of following organizations:)/Parent 10311 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 720 0]>>/Prev 10312 0 R/Next 10315 0 R>>
endobj
10315 0 obj<</Title(C. Regulations - Design has been performed in accordance with applicable regulations and guidelines noted below. Contractor shall carefully apply these regulations and bring any discrepancies to immediate attention of Contracting Officer \(C.O.\).)/Parent 10311 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 468 0]>>/Prev 10314 0 R>>
endobj
10316 0 obj<</Title(1.04 INTENT OF SPECIFICATIONS AND DRAWINGS)/Parent 10294 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 72 414 0]>>/Prev 10311 0 R/First 10317 0 R/Last 10322 0 R/Count 6/Next 10323 0 R>>
endobj
10317 0 obj<</Title(A. Plans and specifications are intended to result in complete electrical installation in full compliance with all applicable codes, standards and ordinances.)/Parent 10316 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 398 0]>>/Next 10318 0 R>>
endobj
10318 0 obj<</Title(B. Plans and specifications are to supplement each other and any details contained in one shall be included as if contained in both.)/Parent 10316 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 370 0]>>/Prev 10317 0 R/Next 10319 0 R>>
endobj
10319 0 obj<</Title(C. Drawings are partly diagrammatic and do not show routing of conduits, exact location of products, or installation features in exact detail. Locations of devices, fixtures and equipment are approximate unless dimensioned.)/Parent 10316 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 343 0]>>/Prev 10318 0 R/Next 10320 0 R>>
endobj
10320 0 obj<</Title(D. Riser diagrams and control schematics are not to scale and do not show physical arrangement of equipment. Do not use riser diagrams or schematics to obtain lineal conduit and cabling distances.)/Parent 10316 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 304 0]>>/Prev 10319 0 R/Next 10321 0 R>>
endobj
10321 0 obj<</Title(E. Items are shown on drawings in locations to minimize interference with other equipment, structural members, etc. Exact finish locations are not indicated, however, and all work shall be done to avoid interference, preserve headroom and keep openings and passageways clear.)/Parent 10316 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 266 0]>>/Prev 10320 0 R/Next 10322 0 R>>
endobj
10322 0 obj<</Title(F. In event that discrepancies of any kind exist or required items/details have been omitted, Contractor shall notify C.O. in writing of such discrepancy or omission at least ten days prior to bid date. Failure to do so shall be construed as willingness of Contractor to supply all necessary materials and labor required for proper completion of work.)/Parent 10316 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 227 0]>>/Prev 10321 0 R>>
endobj
10323 0 obj<</Title(1.05 CONTRACTOR\220S RESPONSIBILITY - Contractor shall be responsible for installation of complete and functional piece of work in accordance with true intent of contract documents. Provide all incidental items required for complete installation and satisfactory operation of all equipment, whether or not specifically noted in contract documents.)/Parent 10294 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 72 176 0]>>/Prev 10316 0 R/First 10324 0 R/Last 10327 0 R/Count 3/Next 10328 0 R>>
endobj
10324 0 obj<</Title(A. QUALIFICATIONS)/Parent 10323 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8194 0 R/XYZ 86 126 0]>>/Next 10326 0 R>>
endobj
10326 0 obj<</Title(B. LICENSING AND CERTIFICATION - All Division 26 work shall be accomplished by Electricians, licensed by state in which work is being done, certified as required, and skilled in their craft. Electrician may elect to hire subcontractors for portions of work \(such as systems described in Divisions 27 and 28\) who are not licensed electricians, but have required certificates and are licensed in their discipline by state in which work is being done.)/Parent 10323 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8197 0 R/XYZ 86 619 0]>>/Prev 10324 0 R/Next 10327 0 R>>
endobj
10327 0 obj<</Title(C. COORDINATION)/Parent 10323 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8197 0 R/XYZ 86 557 0]>>/Prev 10326 0 R>>
endobj
