endobj
10329 0 obj<</Title(A. All work and material is subject to review at any time by the C.O. or his representative. If the C.O. or his representative finds material that does not conform to these specifications or that is not properly installed or finished, correct the deficiencies in a manner satisfactory to the C.O. at the Contractor\220s expense.)/Parent 10328 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8197 0 R/XYZ 93 142 0]>>>>
