10340 0 obj<</Title(B. Electrical equipment may be installed with manufacturer\220s standard finish and color except where specific color, finish or choice is indicated. If the manufacturer has no standard finish, equipment shall have a prime coat and two finish coats of gray enamel.)/Parent 10338 0 R/A<</S/GoTo/D[8200 0 R/XYZ 93 212 0]>>/Prev 10339 0 R/Next 10341 0 R>>
