endobj
10373 0 obj<</Title(A. Verify field measurements and circuiting arrangements as shown on Drawings.)/Parent 10372 0 R/A 10361 0 R/Next 10374 0 R>>
endobj
10374 0 obj<</Title(B. Verify that raceways, wiring and equipment being demo'ed only serve facilities in the designated demolition area.)/Parent 10372 0 R/A 10361 0 R/Prev 10373 0 R/Next 10375 0 R>>
endobj
10375 0 obj<</Title(C. Examine existing light fixtures being removed to verify if ballasts contain PCB's.)/Parent 10372 0 R/A 10361 0 R/Prev 10374 0 R>>
endobj
10376 0 obj<</Title(3.02 PREPARATION)/Parent 10371 0 R/A 10361 0 R/Prev 10372 0 R/First 10377 0 R/Last 10381 0 R/Count 4/Next 10382 0 R>>
endobj
10377 0 obj<</Title(A. Provide temporary wiring and connections to maintain existing systems in service during construction. When work must be performed on energized equipment or circuits, use personnel experienced in such operations and follow the safe working practice requirements of NFPA 70E.)/Parent 10376 0 R/A 10361 0 R/Next 10378 0 R>>
endobj
10378 0 obj<</Title(B. PRE-DEMOLITION MEETING - Participate in a pre-demolition meeting at the project site with Contracting Officer \(C.O.\) and all affected stakeholders.)/Parent 10376 0 R/A 10361 0 R/Prev 10377 0 R/Next 10380 0 R>>
endobj
