endobj
10392 0 obj<</Title(A. Revise electrical connections as required to remove all equipment and items listed herein or shown on plans. Demolish and remove existing construction only to the extent required by new construction and as indicated. Use methods required to complete the Work within limitations of governing regulations)/Parent 10391 0 R/A 10379 0 R/Next 10393 0 R>>
endobj
10393 0 obj<</Title(B. Remove all electrical devices from walls, floors and ceilings that are to be demolished or moved. This includes but is not limited to:)/Parent 10391 0 R/A 10379 0 R/Prev 10392 0 R/Next 10395 0 R>>
endobj
