endobj
10423 0 obj<</Title(A. All lamps contain mercury and/or lead as well as other heavy metals and compounds which are regulated by the EPA. As a result, regulations have been issued covering the handling and disposal of all lamps. Lamps which have been removed from service for disposal shall be handled as follows by the Contractor:)/Parent 10422 0 R/A 10416 0 R>>
