11704 0 obj<</Title(E. Conductors for all notification appliance circuits \(NACs\) shall be sized for distance and current load, in strict accordance with manufacturer's recommendations. Minimum wire size shall be #14 AWG. Whenever practical, NAC wiring should not be larger than #12 AWG wire. Where larger size is required to serve load, additional circuit module shall be provided to split load current.)/Parent 11699 0 R/A 11695 0 R/Prev 11703 0 R/Next 11705 0 R>>
